                Authelia
                <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="9" height="9" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path fill="currentColor" d="M10 1v2h2.3L7.7 7.6l1.4 1.4L13.7 4.4V7h2V1h-5.7zM3 3v10h10V8h-2v3H5V5h3V3H3z"/>
                </svg>
              </a>
            </li>
            <!-- Home section: Calendar & Contacts — REMOVED: rolled into Cloud "Mail" below.
